==Icelandic==
===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|lítill|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*lītilaz}}. Cognate with {{etyl|fo|-}} {{term|lítil|lang=fo}}, {{etyl|da|-}} {{term|liden|lang=da}}, {{etyl|no|-}} {{term|liten|lang=no}}, {{etyl|sv|-}} {{term|liten|lang=sv}}, {{etyl|dlc|-}} {{term|litn|lang=dlc}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈliːtɪtl/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|iːtɪtl|lang=is}}

===Adjective===
{{is-adj|minni|minnstur}}
# [[short]], [[small]]
# [[little]], [[insignificant]]

====Inflection====
{{is-decl-adj-lítill}}

====Derived terms====
